{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261127/photo/bkn-20261127101054974-1127_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261127163252\"/><p>大浪灣泳灘已懸掛紅旗。</p><p>由於大浪關係，康樂及文化事務署今日(27日)宣布，港島南區的大浪灣泳灘已懸掛紅旗，顯示在該處游泳會有危險，市民請勿在該處游泳。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T09:04:04.753102+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":83,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T02:10:54+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T09:17:13.858067+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T08:57:19.543422+00:00","content_hash":"6157eb09820e448990495cf525c245564e22a900dcd42a7589ec1127bea0db63","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-27T09:04:04.753102+00:00","latest_fallback":"minimal","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}